      commonIssues: ["Starting <strong>New activity</strong> from the wrong invoice row.", "Selecting a Sub Status that does not map to <strong>External Dependency</strong>.", "Clearing <strong>Add to issue tracker</strong>.", "Leaving <strong>Action Owner</strong> unselected.", "Assuming submission succeeded without checking the Activity Trail."]
