      body: `<h4>Use Case</h4><p>Create tasks when a case needs owner-based follow-up with a due date.</p><h4>Steps</h4><ol><li>Open case in <strong>Issue Tracker</strong>.</li><li>Click <strong>Create Task</strong> in the action panel.</li><li>Set task title, owner, priority, and due date.</li><li>Add dependency details (invoice, customer, dispute ID).</li><li>Save and verify task appears in assignee queue.</li></ol><h4>Checklist</h4><ul><li>Owner is active and has access.</li><li>Due date aligns with escalation SLA.</li><li>Task contains measurable completion criteria.</li></ul>`
