      body: `<h4>When A PDC Bounces</h4><p>Immediately update status so downstream risk and follow-up tasks are triggered.</p><h4>Steps</h4><ol><li>Open PDC record and change status to <strong>Bounced</strong>.</li><li>Capture bounce reason and bank memo details.</li><li>Create follow-up task for collection owner with due date.</li><li>Notify manager/action owner via system communication.</li><li>Update linked invoice collection status and remarks.</li></ol><h4>Documents To Attach</h4><ul><li>Bank return memo</li><li>Cheque image/reference</li><li>Customer communication proof</li></ul>`
