      body: `<h4>Purpose</h4><p>Review the KAS portfolio totals before focusing on an individual KAM.</p><h4>Prerequisites</h4><ul><li>Sign in with a KAS account.</li><li>Open the KAS Dashboard.</li></ul><h4>Steps</h4><ol><li>Confirm the page heading says KAS Dashboard.</li><li>Review the top cards: Total Portfolio, Total Target (MTD), Total Achievement, Open Issues, and Total Invoices.</li><li>Locate KAM Summary and confirm it says “Team summary (all KAMs)” when no KAM is selected.</li><li>Use KAM Portfolio to identify the KAM you need to review.</li></ol><h4>Validation</h4><ul><li>The five overview cards and KAM Summary are visible.</li><li>KAM Portfolio lists KAM rows.</li><li>No KAM is selected when the all-KAM label is shown.</li></ul><h4>Common issues</h4><ul><li>Reading dashboard totals as one KAM’s figures.</li><li>Treating Total Target (MTD) and Total Achievement as the same figure.</li><li>Using a KAM row without first checking its name.</li></ul>`
